      "previous_keys": {"b": ["Backspace"], "y": ["R"], "left_shoulder": ["1"], "right_shoulder": ["3"]},
      "name": "Original PC (2003)",
      "text": "The keys of the 2003 Windows release: arrow keys, C to jump, Space to shoot, Ctrl to lock on, Esc to pause. W rolls, hold X to look, V shows health / grimace. The camera is on the numeric keypad (or A S D) and Shift walks.",
      "evidence": "Rayman 3: Hoodlum Havoc English PC manual, original three-CD edition (https://www.raymanpc.com/Img/rayman3_manual.pdf; matching UK DVD copy https://raymanpc.com/wiki/images/9/9e/R3PCUKManual.pdf), printed pp. 7-9; copyright 2003 on p. 18. Page 7: W roll, V life bar and funny face; p. 8: X look mode, p. 9: keep X held. Arrows, C jump, Space shoot, left Ctrl lock-on, Esc pause, F1 freeze; p. 5 Enter confirm and Backspace back. PC evidence only; human HD observations establish B=Roll/Back, Y=Look, LB=Health, RB=Grimace. Camera keys and Walk are project additions. Backspace remains B's second key; W is no longer a camera alias. D-120 / E-280.",
      "keys": {
